      <div type="clause" n="18.2, 19">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Ger">Ger</ref> 18.2, 19</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">fela sceal to holdan hames ge|refan . 7 to gemetfæstan manna hyrde . ic ge|cende be ðam ðe ic cuðe . se ðe bet cunne ge|cyðe his mare</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">Many things are needed of a faithful reeve, and a responsible overseer of men. I have spoken about that which I know; he who knows better should make known more.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">[18.2] Fela sceal to holden hames gerefan 7 to gemetfæstan manna hyrde. [19] Ic gecende be ðam ðe ic cuðe; se ðe bet cunne, gecyðe his mare.</ab>
      </div>
